    { "type": "key-down", "keys": ["w"] },
    {
      "type": "wait-for",
      "note": "Hold the throttle until the SUV does 5 m/s, not for a fixed time: a CI software frame can outlast a short hold, and a car that never left its parking space had no room to exit.",
